        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo 14 - 5 Inch Door Pull</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThis 5\" Center to Center (CTC)  door pull is made from 3/4\" diameter solid round bar stock. The easy use and clean style makes it great for any office, hospital, school, or store front doors. Packaged with mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/6-inch-door-pull-3-4-inch-diameter-don-jo-15\"><b>6\" Door Pull</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/8-inch-door-pull-3-4-inch-diameter-don-jo-16\"><b>8\" Door Pull</b></a>,  <a href=\"/products/10-inch-door-pull-3-4-inch-diameter-don-jo-17\"><b>10\" Door Pull</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nMade of <br>\r\n*Solid Stainless Steel:  Satin Stainless Steel finishe.\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Don-Jo 14 5\" Commercial Door Pull\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Diameter: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center (CTC): 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Bar Stock</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with Mounting Hardware</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/14.pdf?v=1704262236\" target=\"new\"><b>Don-Jo 14 Door Pull Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged Standard with Thru-Bolt mounting (Bolts through the door). Optional Surface mounting or Back to Back mounting available (Pulls bolt to each other - Requires 2 door pulls).\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold individually (1 door pull handle).</b>\r\n</p>",
